By The Bay app is designed to enhance the urban lifestyles of professionals working and living by the bay, particularly in and around Marina Bay Financial Centre (MBFC) and One Raffles Quay (ORQ). MBFC and ORQ are premium developments that account for 4.5 million square feet of prime Grade A office and 179,000 square feet of retail space in Singapore’s downtown at Marina Bay.

By The Bay app provides convenient digital access to the buildings and services, information and amenities, flexible workspace solutions. as well as activities and promotions to complement work-live-play lifestyles by the bay. 
Download now to enhance your experience working and living by the bay. 

•	Convenient digital (card-less) access to the buildings and services, including season parking, aircon extension and fault reporting;
•	Information including the most current events, shows and exhibitions happening by the bay;
•	Retail and dining promotions and activities including fitness classes and healthy living workshops, dining and shopping promotions;
•	Concierge services and amenities, wayfinding, umbrellas and power banks on loan etc; as well as
•	Flexible workspace solutions and useful tips on how to conserve the environment. 

Please email queries to management@rqam.com.sg.

Aqara Home is an app for smart home automation and control. With Aqara Home, you can:

1. control Aqara accessories anywhere and anytime where there is Internet access;

2. create homes and rooms and assign accessories to the rooms;

3. control your Aqara accessories and check the status of connected appliances. For example:
    *adjust the brightness of lights and check the power consumption of home appliances;
    *monitor the temperature, humidity and air pressure;
    *detect water leak, and human movement;

4. create Automations to automate your home. For example:
     *set a timer to turn on or off an appliance connected to a smart plug;
     *use a Door and Window Sensor to trigger lights: turn on lights automatically when the door opens;

5. create Scenes to control multiple accessories. For example, add a Scene to turn on multiple lights and fans; 

6. ask Siri to control HomeKit supported Aqara accessories and user defined Scenes; Aqara Home app supports following Aqara accessories: Aqara Hub, Smart Plug, Wireless Remote Switch, LED Light Bulb, Door and Window Sensor, Motion Sensor, Temperature and Humidity Sensor, Vibration Sensor, and Water Leak Sensor.  Please see www.aqara.com for more details.
